    "turn_text": "can do. Yeah, you mentioned McMorris Rogers. What advice would you have for her as a former Energy and Commerce Committee chairman? And, you know, she's really promising this kind of aggressive oversight agenda. I mean, do you see any risk in kind of Republicans overreaching and opposing the Biden climate policies and kind of detracting from this message of we want to be in the game on climate?",
