  {
    "episode_id": 95524,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/5/95524.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 10,
    "turn_text": "What did you learn from the current energy crisis? And of course, Russia's invasion of Ukraine is a big part of that. COVID started the elevation in prices. But you have Democrats saying, this really shows the perils of depending on fossil fuels, and we should actually be accelerating the transition. Is that something you agree with?",
